{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>股評人趙晞文於節目中，再次推介H&amp;H國際(1112)，他繼續看好業績能帶動股價，預期季度營運數據佳，加上公司市佔率續提升，有利估值重估。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"4325.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bXBQkT09421792650429.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>趙晞文認為19.8元可買入，目標價上望23元，若失守17.5元便止蝕。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"4326.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/202611MzCg2qZg1792650447.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p></p><p>H&amp;H國際(1112)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：$19.8</p><p>目標：$23</p><p>止蝕：$17.5</p><p></p><p>股評人李明德推介從事時尚服裝江南布衣(3306)，指出公司全年業績新高，並有充沛現金流，加上派高息等因素，屬於攻守兼備的股份，而公司建立粉絲經濟，可以築起深厚護城河維持營收。</p><p>李明德建議現價即22元買入，目標價看26.5元，止蝕價在20元。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"4323.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026uX3jiuvHZL1792650474.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>江南布衣(3306)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：現價→$22</p><p>目標：$26.5</p><p>止蝕：$20</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"4324.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026TYKDVEGjHn1792650502.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T07:22:12.857900+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T06:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T08:37:58.586421+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T07:17:42.788100+00:00","content_hash":"89efc9ca3ce5cfdeb43c165ab22e5dd459ccc1046b980573b5e46e1208f9ff35","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}